      <activity id="fd74a128-9e73-586e-b343-103f6c500952" activityNameId="5dc36eee-6e89-5f26-9598-4e73f8549031" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Esterquat, tallow, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Esterquat, tallow, at plant
data based on the ECOSOL study of the European surfactant industry. Allocations in multioutput processes were made, using the relative mass outputs of products.;
UUID: 00edfa61-f21e-3658-aaa4-1d03503b8f47
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of esterquat out of tallow. Transports and infrastructure have been estimated. No water consumption and no process emissions are included.
Location: Data based on the European esterquat production
Technology: Average technology for the production of esterquat out of tallow by esterification with triethanolamine and quaternication with DMS. Data representing typical European production mix in the mid 90s.
Time period: data of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: data out of ECOSOL study of European Surfactant Industry. Common translation rules used, reported in Chemical report (Althaus et al. 2003). 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_00edfa61-f21e-3658-aaa4-1d03503b8f47.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
